---
title: Old English Christmas Rub
source: https://compkitchen.com/recipe/69690
author: Jamie Oliver
course: Seasoning
locale: en_GB
difficulty: Easy
prep time: 10m
cuisine: British
diet: Vegetarian
tags:
- vegetarian
- rub
- seasoning
- savoury
- christmas
- british
---

Blend @orange{1}(peel of), @lemon{1}(peel of), @bay leaves{4}, @allspice berries{4}, @fennel seeds{2%tbsp}, @sea salt{8%tbsp}, @cinnamon{1%stick}, @fresh rosemary{4%sprigs}(leaves picked), @fresh thyme{4%sprigs}(leaves picked), and @nutmeg{0.5}(grated).